  "name": "dotfiles",
  "description": "A comprehensive Unix environment configuration suite centered around keyboard-driven, console-based workflows. It integrates a modular Zsh setup using the Pure prompt, a terminal-based email stack comprising Mutt, Notmuch, and mbsync for asynchronous mail synchronization. The system automates deployment via a symlink-based installation script and manages diverse configurations for herbstluftwm, tmux, and X11 terminal extensions.",
